{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SNEAKALOT is a single player open world stealth mission game where you play as Naomi, an activist on a mission to expose a corrupt military government. Navigate a military invaded and torn city, with lots of soldiers stationed and dynamically patrolling making your gameplay experience unique. You could whistle, throw stones or set off car alarms to distract soldiers. You can hide in tall bushes, in lockers, under large vehicles or in a garbage bin to conceal yourself, but take into account every sound you make. Soldiers can hear your footsteps and its louder if you RUN. From your footsteps, to the type of surfaces you walk on, to the possibility of a car alarm getting triggered if you sneak too close. DON'T GET CAUGHT !!!\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains the first mission of the full game, replayable on completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stealth Approach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/6222156212375b6613d25bb4a05353af.poster.avif?t=1754071194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/6222156212375b6613d25bb4a05353af.webm?t=1754071194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/6222156212375b6613d25bb4a05353af.mp4?t=1754071194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whistle, throw stones or set off car alarm to distract soldiers so as to make way or get away from a tough situation. Be a master of stealth and deception, know when to run and not to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use Your Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/03564e4b536451c465fa6cf627f100e2.poster.avif?t=1754071194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/03564e4b536451c465fa6cf627f100e2.webm?t=1754071194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/03564e4b536451c465fa6cf627f100e2.mp4?t=1754071194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of objects around you can be used to conceal yourself, from the tall bushes to the garbage bin, lockers and large vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/befc5dc4c1578c9a845f771206f7ac24.poster.avif?t=1754071194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/befc5dc4c1578c9a845f771206f7ac24.webm?t=1754071194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/befc5dc4c1578c9a845f771206f7ac24.mp4?t=1754071194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think fast, think smart. Running is not always the best decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Always Scan Your Surroundings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/c9cb480bf3558769ca0116f563535977.poster.avif?t=1754071194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/c9cb480bf3558769ca0116f563535977.webm?t=1754071194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/c9cb480bf3558769ca0116f563535977.mp4?t=1754071194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always scan your surroundings for places to hide and for the perfect path to follow. The path you follow will determine your survival. Use objects in your surrounding to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Watch Your Every Step</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/0a849b0049b7a3d624cc9bfc9bb2d6c9.poster.avif?t=1754071194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/0a849b0049b7a3d624cc9bfc9bb2d6c9.webm?t=1754071194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/0a849b0049b7a3d624cc9bfc9bb2d6c9.mp4?t=1754071194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soldiers are always at alert and always listening. Your every step counts, objects all around you could either help you or work against you. From the sound of the surface you walk on to the items you collide with, watch your steps. Stay quiet, stay hidden. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning</strong> : <strong>Grab your headset</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You Snooze, You DIE </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/b53dc28137073452b60c2031c021007b.poster.avif?t=1754071194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/b53dc28137073452b60c2031c021007b.webm?t=1754071194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/extras/b53dc28137073452b60c2031c021007b.mp4?t=1754071194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They take no prisoners. Do not get caught. You snooze, you DIE !</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904600?t=1754071194","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/9f2465946a069f4128b04dd7786e0f9bee88c853/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754071194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/1989839e0b786c6dd14f22034a7313202b7d550f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754071194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904600/1989839e0b786c6dd14f22034a7313202b7d550f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754071194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SNEAKALOT is a single player open world stealth mission game where you play as Naomi, an activist on a mission to expose a corrupt military government. Navigate a military invaded and torn city, with lots of soldiers stationed and dynamically patrolling making your gameplay experience unique. You could whistle, throw stones or set off car alarms to distract soldiers. You can hide in tall bushes, in lockers, under large vehicles or in a garbage bin to conceal yourself, but take into account every sound you make. So